From 0c947d9f8c5de765a7d530a87f14ae128263a6c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UMP <ump@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 85/90] The client's entity render dispatcher exists before its
 resource reload

Minecraft's constructor makes its EntityRenderDispatcher before the first resource reload; the mirror made it on the first entity drawn, after. Mods' reload listeners that read it (Kiwi's: getEntityRenderDispatcher().getPlayerRenderers()) failed alone and again with the models. HorizonEntityRender.dispatcher() makes it (with the players' renderers) before the mods' client reload.

UMP 184 mods: Kiwi's reload listener runs (17 of the mods' reload listeners ran, was 16 with Kiwi failing twice).
---
 .../dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonClient.java     |  2 ++
 .../horizonlab/platform/HorizonEntityRender.java   | 14 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonClient.java b/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonClient.java
index 74becb107b..efd6931614 100644
--- a/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonClient.java
+++ b/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonClient.java
@@ -2749,6 +2749,8 @@ public final class HorizonClient {
                 Natives.log("Horizon's client: the GPU's shaders couldn't be loaded: " + t);
             }
         }
+        // The entity render dispatcher, which Minecraft's constructor makes before this reload.
+        HorizonEntityRender.dispatcher();
         java.util.concurrent.Executor here = Runnable::run;
         int ran = 0;
         int skipped = 0;
diff --git a/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonEntityRender.java b/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonEntityRender.java
index f2a85ed756..5c51cd165e 100644
--- a/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonEntityRender.java
+++ b/crates/horizon-jvm/java/platform/dev/horizonlab/platform/HorizonEntityRender.java
@@ -126,6 +126,20 @@ public final class HorizonEntityRender {
         return context;
     }
 
+    /**
+     * The client's entity render dispatcher (Minecraft.getEntityRenderDispatcher) made now, as
+     * Minecraft's constructor makes it before its first resource reload: mods' reload listeners
+     * read it (Kiwi's player renderers: getEntityRenderDispatcher().getPlayerRenderers() was null,
+     * and its reload failed). (UMP, 2026-11-15)
+     */
+    static void dispatcher() {
+        try {
+            context();
+        } catch (Throwable t) {
+            Natives.log("Java mods: the client's entity renderers couldn't be made before its reload: " + t);
+        }
+    }
+
     /**
      * The client's models are in (HorizonClient.finishModels): the renderers' contexts are made
      * again with its block models, and renderers that failed for want of them are tried again.
-- 
